---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { withBase } from '../../lib/site';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Teaching & Outreach"
  description="Teaching, research supervision, AI education, community engagement and academic service by Yaya Etiabi."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="eyebrow">Teaching &amp; engagement</div>
      <h1>Teaching &amp; Outreach</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Alongside my research, I have taught programming and machine learning,
        supervised research projects, contributed to AI education initiatives,
        and served scientific and professional communities.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="container page-content">
    <div class="detail-grid">
      <article class="prose">
        <h2>Teaching and training</h2>
        <p>
          My teaching experience includes classroom instruction, tutoring,
          laboratory sessions and practical AI training. I have worked with
          learners on programming fundamentals, machine learning methods
          and their implementation.
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>C programming:</strong> laboratory instruction involving programming exercises, implementation and debugging.</li>
          <li><strong>Machine learning:</strong> classes and tutoring covering core methods, model implementation and evaluation.</li>
          <li><strong>Introduction to AI with Python:</strong> hands-on training combining introductory concepts and programming exercises.</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="activity-feature" id="ml-class-um6p">
          <img
            src={withBase('/media/um6p-ml-class.jpg')}
            alt="Machine learning class for the UM6P International Student Community"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
          <div>
            <h3>Machine learning classes · UM6P International Student Community</h3>
            <p>
              Delivered in-person sessions on Python programming and the foundations
              of machine learning, with practical exercises.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h2>Research supervision and mentoring</h2>
        <p>
          I have supervised research projects in machine learning for wireless
          localization, providing guidance from problem formulation and methodology
          to implementation, experimental evaluation and interpretation of results.
        </p>

        <h2>Program facilitation and community engagement</h2>
        <h3>Emerging Leaders in AI · Black in AI</h3>
        <p>
          As a program facilitator, I have contributed to learning activities,
          participant engagement, mentoring and review activities within
          the Emerging Leaders in AI program.
        </p>
        <h3>AURA Association</h3>
        <p>
          As Director of Scientific and Thematic Content, I contribute to
          defining scientific themes and developing content for the association's
          activities.
        </p>

        <h2>AI education and public engagement</h2>
        <div id="ai-training-webinar">
          <h3>AI training webinar series</h3>
          <p>
            Delivered introductory webinars covering AI fundamentals, practical
            applications and hands-on exercises for a broader audience.
          </p>
        </div>
        <p>
          I have also participated in public discussions as a panelist on AI
          in the workplace and the role of connectivity and AI in development.
          Details of these events are available under
          <a href={withBase('/talks/#panels')}>Panels &amp; Forums</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>Academic service</h2>
        <div id="ieee-reviewer-tpc-member">
          <p>
            I served on the Technical Program Committee for <strong>IEEE WCNC 2024</strong>
            and have reviewed papers for IEEE ICC and IEEE GLOBECOM, as well as
            manuscripts for IEEE Transactions on Wireless Communications,
            IEEE Internet of Things Journal and IEEE Sensors Journal.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <aside class="sidebar-panel">
        <h3>Related pages</h3>
        <p class="small"><a href={withBase('/about/')}>About ↗</a></p>
        <p class="small"><a href={withBase('/talks/')}>Talks &amp; Presentations ↗</a></p>
        <p class="small"><a href={withBase('/publications/')}>Publications ↗</a></p>
        <p class="small"><a href={withBase('/contact/')}>Contact ↗</a></p>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
